        "date": "2026-02-24T18:31:13Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(data): correct CSR field references and access checks in CBO specs\n\n- Fix cbo.clean and cbo.flush access_detail text: CBZE -> CBCFE\n  (CBZE controls cbo.zero, CBCFE controls clean/flush)\n- Fix cbo.zero description: \"Clean operations\" -> \"Zero operations\"\n- Fix cbo.zero operation() access checks:\n  - Remove incorrect M-mode trap (M always has access)\n  - Add missing S-mode check when menvcfg.CBZE=0\n  - Fix VU-mode: trap when ANY envcfg bit is 0, not only when ALL are 0\n  - Add misa.S/misa.H guards for CSR existence\n\nFixes #1684",
